###  https://purl.archive.org/nudging#Urbanization_Increase_Inequality
<https://purl.archive.org/nudging#Urbanization_Increase_Inequality> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                             <https://purl.archive.org/nudging#AcademicPaper> ;
                                                                    <https://purl.archive.org/nudging#addressesIssue> <https://purl.archive.org/nudging#urbanization_intensifies_inequality> ;
