                                                                    <https://purl.archive.org/nudging#DOI> "https://doi.org/10.1080/07352166.2023.2252538"^^xsd:anyURI ;
                                                                    <https://purl.archive.org/nudging#year> 2023 ;
                                                                    rdfs:comment """Does Urbanization Increase Inequality? Race, Gender, and the Urban Wage Premium; 
This study examines how population density impacts racial and gender wage gaps across U.S. cities, controlling for confounding factors. The study examines whether urban settings exacerbate wage gaps among different demographic groups, considering factors like education, occupation, and industry."""@en ;
